        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a351fd1e4f1541f2bfa8022f49d07ecd",
      "statement": "INTERNAL_TOKEN is a fail-closed gate enforced at both entrypoints: agents/feishu/index.ts returns 503 when the token is unset and 401 on mismatch, and cloud-functions/feishu-webhook/index.ts likewise returns 503 when unset — because the agents/ route is publicly reachable and anyone could otherwise burn the project's model quota.",
