      "statement": "INTERNAL_TOKEN doubles as the HMAC signing key for OAuth state: /login signs state with it and the OAuth callback verifies with the same value, so the CF relay (cf-agent-lab) that holds the same EO_INTERNAL_TOKEN value can verify it without distributing an extra secret.",
