      "statement": "AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY / AI_GATEWAY_BASE_URL / AI_GATEWAY_MODEL are platform-managed and reset on every deploy by the CLI's 'Bound AI Gateway credentials to project', so custom credentials must use ordinary key names (OPENCODE_*, GITHUB_WORKSPACE_TOKEN) that survive deployment; the model name has its own independent precedence OPENCODE_MODEL → AI_GATEWAY_MODEL → hardcoded default.",
