    {
      "id": "claim_3fb7ebf3f99645eea85424f225c3500d",
      "statement": "FEISHU_DISPATCH_MODE selects async (default: reply 202 then run the turn in the background, webhook ACKs immediately) or sync (run to completion before responding, not depending on background execution), can be overridden per-request by the ?mode= query parameter, and the correct value is decided by the ?probe=start/?probe=check self-test — sync also returns the turn's replies in the response body.",
