      "id": "claim_6e74d99da6264abaadfd803147ef63bb",
      "statement": "SANDBOX_ENABLED governs the whole platform sandbox tool family: setting it to 0/false/off (case-insensitive, unset means enabled) removes every platform tool, and even when enabled a fixed set (browser_screenshot/browser_click/browser_type/browser_evaluate/files_remove) is always excluded, with the platform's built-in web_search additionally stripped whenever the self-built serper web_search is mounted.",
