      "statement": "SERPER_API_KEY gates the self-built web_search: with no key makeSearchTools returns an empty array so the search tool disappears entirely (rather than mounting a failing tool the model would repeatedly hit), and mounting it forces removal of the platform's built-in same-named web_search which is broken without WSA_API_KEY.",
