      "id": "claim_92ba9471af9d42dd9107dddb29acc7c0",
      "statement": "Changing console environment variables does not take effect immediately — a running agent uses the snapshot packaged at deploy time, so config changes require a redeploy; ?probe=env exists to distinguish 'wrong value' from 'not applied' by echoing the variable-name list plus INTERNAL_TOKEN's length and first 4 characters only.",
