      "statement": "The ?probe=env endpoint filters visible variable names through the whitelist regex /FEISHU|INTERNAL|AI_|AGENT|SANDBOX|SERPER|OPENCODE|GITHUB/, so a newly added variable stays invisible to the probe until the regex is updated — a mistake already made twice with SERPER and GITHUB.",
