      "id": "claim_9c5c6408ac12473083c70ab6de1d2af9",
      "statement": "Feature gating follows a uniform 'half-configured counts as unconfigured' rule: no half-configured credential mounts a tool family, because a family of always-failing tools only makes the model repeatedly hit a wall (shared by resolveModelRoute, searchTools, ghWorkspaceConfig, ghIssueConfig and the memory backend).",
