      "statement": "FEISHU_USER_TOKEN_SKEW_MS artificially widens the access-token expiry skew (default 5 minutes, suggesting e.g. 7200000 = 2 hours) purely so the refresh path can be exercised on demand; it is meant to be unset in normal operation and is covered by a focused test asserting that a fresh token is judged expired once the skew is widened.",
