      "statement": "The internal token reader accepts three shapes — a standard Headers object, a plain object with case variants, and the request body — because the runtime's context.request.headers is not a standard Headers instance (headers.get and forEach are absent), which previously made every forwarded request 401 with a misleading 'mismatch' message.",
